  "important_findings": [
    "Original .db files contain hardware INP/OUT transport details and working CALC/FLNK links stripped by the simulation .db copies.",
    "EMU records use $(DEVICE), $(CNAME) macros expanded in startup substitutions, so these must not be mistaken for literal PV names.",
    "Original RF status bits come from Mot105; PwrRef displays Mot103*0.9.",
    "VAC01 and VAC02 PV/SV preconditions are EPICS calculations for OPI, not authoritative PLC safety.",
    "Original TIM Cyclut=Trep/TPulse, inverse of physical duty cycle. Use separate physical-duty metric.",
    "Original RC_PS IRdbkcalc uses full scale 1 while Icalcout uses 10. Keep as a flagged calibration inconsistency.",
    "Actual PLC ladder PDFs and LabVIEW CIM binaries are available but not decoded or certified as current 2026 logic."
